{"id":"aber","lemma":"aber","pos":"conj","rank":22,"glosses":["but","however"],"ipa":"/ˈaːbɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/De-aber.ogg/De-aber.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich will eins, aber nicht dieses.","en":"I want one, but not this one.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"one (numerical value…"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"}]},{"text":"Entschuldigung, aber können Sie mir helfen?","en":"Excuse me, but can you help me?","words":[{"g":"apology"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Aber du bist nicht dort.","en":"But you're not there.","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there, yonder"}]},{"text":"Er war klein, aber stark.","en":"He was small, but strong.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"small, little, wee"},null,{"g":"strong"}]},{"text":"Es ist unglaublich, aber wahr.","en":"It's unbelievable but true.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"unbelievably"},null,{"g":"true, real"}]}]}